    "text": "Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>9</mn><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math><br /><br />Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></msup></mfenced></math><br /><br />So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math><br /><br />We know that,&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mro